<!DOCTYPE html>
<html lang="en">
<head>
<meta charset="UTF-8">
<meta name="viewport" content="width=device-width, initial-scale=1.0">

<title>JAH KNOW STAR CHARITY HOME | Ghana</title>

<meta name="description" content="JAH KNOW STAR CHARITY HOME supports vulnerable children in Ghana through education, food, clothing and essential care.">

<style>
* {
    box-sizing: border-box;
    margin: 0;
    padding: 0;
}

body {
    font-family: Arial, sans-serif;
    line-height: 1.6;
    color: #222;
    background: #fff;
}

header {
    background: #111;
    color: white;
    padding: 18px 20px;
    position: sticky;
    top: 0;
    z-index: 100;
}

.logo {
    font-size: 21px;
    font-weight: bold;
    color: #ffd700;
}

nav {
    margin-top: 10px;
}

nav a {
    color: white;
    text-decoration: none;
    margin-right: 12px;
    font-size: 14px;
}

.hero {
    background: linear-gradient(135deg, #ffd700, #fff3a3);
    padding: 70px 22px;
    text-align: center;
}

.hero h1 {
    font-size: 38px;
    margin-bottom: 15px;
}

.hero p {
    font-size: 18px;
    max-width: 650px;
    margin: auto;
}

.button {
    display: inline-block;
    margin-top: 25px;
    padding: 14px 24px;
    background: #111;
    color: white;
    text-decoration: none;
    border-radius: 30px;
    font-weight: bold;
}

section {
    padding: 55px 20px;
    max-width: 1050px;
    margin: auto;
}

section h2 {
    text-align: center;
    font-size: 30px;
    margin-bottom: 25px;
}

.intro {
    text-align: center;
    max-width: 750px;
    margin: auto;
}

.cards {
    display: grid;
    grid-template-columns: repeat(auto-fit, minmax(220px, 1fr));
    gap: 20px;
    margin-top: 30px;
}

.card {
    background: #f7f7f7;
    padding: 25px;
    border-radius: 15px;
    text-align: center;
    box-shadow: 0 3px 12px rgba(0,0,0,0.08);
}

.card h3 {
    margin-bottom: 10px;
}

.donate {
    background: #111;
    color: white;
    text-align: center;
    max-width: none;
}

.donate h2 {
    color: #ffd700;
}

.contact {
    text-align: center;
}

.contact p {
    margin: 9px 0;
}

.contact a {
    color: #111;
    font-weight: bold;
}

footer {
    background: #050505;
    color: white;
    text-align: center;
    padding: 25px 15px;
    font-size: 14px;
}

@media (max-width: 600px) {
    .hero h1 {
        font-size: 30px;
    }

    nav a {
        font-size: 13px;
    }
}
</style>
</head>

<body>

<header>
    <div class="logo">🌟 JAH KNOW STAR CHARITY HOME</div>

    <nav>
        <a href="#about">About</a>
        <a href="#programs">Programs</a>
        <a href="#needs">Needs</a>
        <a href="#donate">Donate</a>
        <a href="#contact">Contact</a>
    </nav>
</header>

<section class="hero">
    <h1>Every Child Deserves a Chance to Shine 🌟</h1>

    <p>
        JAH KNOW STAR CHARITY HOME is committed to supporting
        vulnerable children in Ghana with care, education,
        food, clothing and essential needs.
    </p>

    <a class="button"
       href="https://wa.me/233536695819?text=Hello%20JAH%20KNOW%20STAR%20CHARITY%20HOME%2C%20I%20would%20like%20to%20support%20your%20mission.">
       Support Our Mission
    </a>
</section>

<section id="about">
    <h2>About Us</h2>

    <p class="intro">
        JAH KNOW STAR CHARITY HOME is a Ghana-based charitable
        initiative dedicated to helping vulnerable and
        disadvantaged children receive the care, support and
        opportunities they deserve.
        <br><br>
        Our goal is to help children grow in a safe,
        caring environment while supporting their education,
        nutrition, clothing and everyday needs.
    </p>
</section>

<section id="programs">
    <h2>What We Do</h2>

    <div class="cards">

        <div class="card">
            <h3>🎓 Education</h3>
            <p>
                Supporting children's education with school
                supplies, books, learning materials and other
                educational needs.
            </p>
        </div>

        <div class="card">
            <h3>🍲 Food & Nutrition</h3>
            <p>
                Helping provide nutritious food and essential
                household supplies for children in need.
            </p>
        </div>

        <div class="card">
            <h3>👕 Clothing & Care</h3>
            <p>
                Providing clothing, shoes, personal items and
                other necessities that help children live with
                dignity.
            </p>
        </div>

        <div class="card">
            <h3>❤️ Child Support</h3>
            <p>
                Creating a caring environment where vulnerable
                children can receive encouragement, attention
                and support.
            </p>
        </div>

    </div>
</section>

<section id="needs">
    <h2>Current Donation Needs</h2>

    <div class="cards">

        <div class="card">
            <h3>🍚 Food</h3>
            <p>Rice, cooking oil, milk, drinks and other food supplies.</p>
        </div>

        <div class="card">
            <h3>🎒 School Supplies</h3>
            <p>School bags, books, pens, pencils and mathematical sets.</p>
        </div>

        <div class="card">
            <h3>🛏️ Mattresses</h3>
            <p>Student mattresses and other sleeping essentials.</p>
        </div>

        <div class="card">
            <h3>👚 Clothing</h3>
            <p>Clothes, socks, underwear and other children's clothing.</p>
        </div>

    </div>
</section>

<section id="donate" class="donate">
    <h2>Help a Child Shine 🌟</h2>

    <p>
        Your support can help provide food, education,
        clothing and essential care to vulnerable children.
    </p>

    <a class="button"
       href="https://wa.me/233536695819?text=Hello%20JAH%20KNOW%20STAR%20CHARITY%20HOME%2C%20I%20would%20like%20to%20make%20a%20donation.">
       Donate / Support Us
    </a>
</section>

<section id="contact" class="contact">
    <h2>Contact Us</h2>

    <p>📞 Call: <a href="tel:+233536695819">+233 536 695 819</a></p>

    <p>
        💬 WhatsApp:
        <a href="https://wa.me/233536695819">
            +233 536 695 819
        </a>
    </p>

    <p>
        📧 Email:
        <a href="mailto:jahknowstar2546@gmail.com">
            jahknowstar2546@gmail.com
        </a>
    </p>

    <p>
        🎵 TikTok:
        <a href="https://www.tiktok.com/@jahknowstar_charity">
            @jahknowstar_charity
        </a>
    </p>

    <p>🇬🇭 Country: Ghana</p>
</section>

<footer>
    <p>🌟 JAH KNOW STAR CHARITY HOME</p>
    <p>Every child deserves love, care and an opportunity to shine.</p>
    <p>© 2026 JAH KNOW STAR CHARITY HOME. All rights reserved.</p>
</footer>

</body>
</html>
